00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.410
Although no matter how many times I write to him, he never replies...

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.810
France...

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.400
Paris, huh...

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.220
I wonder where in Paris Henri-sensei lives?

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.420
I wish I could see him...

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.750
I haven't been to Japan for a while.

