Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:01.910
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:09.450
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.240
I have cooking practice next, I have to hurry!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.150
Wait, wasn't that Henri-sensei outside just now?

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.370
Yeah, as if...

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:28.390
recipe 35

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:28.390
Welcome, Henri-sensei

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.080
Ichigo-chan, listen well! I got super crucial news!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.020
I hear Henri-sensei is about to show up at the academy!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.130
Wait, then before...

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.390
Henri-sensei is coming back to the academy...

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.460
I want to see him right away!

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.810
Amano-san!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.660
Is there something outside the window?

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.220
N-No...

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:59.710
The most important thing about decorating is concentration.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:00.830
So concentrate!

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:01.910
I'm sorry.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.370
Umm, where is Henri-sensei right now?

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.610
Henri-sensei... Does she mean Henri Lucas?

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.250
Wasn't he in Paris?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.640
Quiet!

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:21.470
Henri-sensei arrived in Japan last night, and came to visit the St. Marie Academy a short while ago.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.900
I knew it!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.020
But we are currently in the middle of class.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.430
Concentrate on your lesson!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.350
I'm off!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.980
Wait! We're not done cleaning up yet!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.980
Henri-sensei...

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.820
Henri-sensei is right in front of me!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.440
I'm not dreaming, right?

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.180
Owww!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.070
It hurts? Then it's not a dream!

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:52.820
That's so mean!

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.590
You're supposed to find it out by pinching your own cheek!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.950
Henri-sensei, it's Amano Ichigo!

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.910
Henri-sensei, hey!

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.190
I'm sorry!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:17.730
And who was it exactly that suggested we all do special training after school for the Grand Prix?

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.020
Umm... Me.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:23.450
It was your idea and now you're canceling, huh?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:28.700
It's just that Henri-sensei is back, and I wanted to greet him as soon as I could.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.430
Henri-sensei can wait for later, right?

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:37.380
I will teach you all about my sweets crafting techniques.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.280
I'm really sorry!

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.100
I'll make it up to you, I promise!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:41.590
Please!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.590
It's okay, Amano-san. You get going.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.310
Thank you!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:51.310
Although I am more beautiful than Henri Lucas...

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.350
What's with her?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.440
There's nothing we can do.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:59.080
Henri-sensei is someone special to Amano-san. It's only to be expected that she'd be a bit ecstatic.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.030
Aren't you angry?

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.750
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't, but she seems so happy.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.200
I wouldn't want to put a cloud on that smile of hers.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.920
Ah well...

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:12.620
I suppose Henri-sensei can have her today.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.440
He was originally a teacher on the Paris campus anyway.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.920
What'd he come here for?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.920
I figured this is where you'd be.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.000
And why is that?

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.270
Because this is your favorite place, sensei.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.430
Didn't we used to talk here quite often?

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.640
I can't fool you, huh, Mari.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.820
You're being as straightforward as always, I see.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.580
How confident are you about the Grand Prix?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.300
Hmm... I wonder myself...

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.800
You say that, but your eyes are sparkling bright.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:04.000
I was correct to bring Amano Ichigo into this school, wasn't I?

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:08.690
Mari, you aren't there yet.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:13.760
As long as you continue to chase my footsteps, you will never be able to move ahead of me.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.240
But... I...

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:22.730
I will not be satisfied if you stay as you are now.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.280
Neither will your partner, Honey.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.810
Henri-sensei...

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:49.260
Henri-sensei! Henri-sensei!!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.140
You weren't able to meet Henri-sensei?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.750
No... He got in a taxi and left somewhere.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.810
He's probably already on his way back to Paris.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.810
Didn't he just go back to his hotel?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:07.030
That reminds me, I heard that tomorrow Henri-sensei is holding a class in the high school.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.600
Really!?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:12.640
Looks like he'll be here for a little while, so I'm sure you'll see him tomorrow!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.920
I see...

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.160
That's right...

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.450
I can meet him tomorrow!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:21.620
That's it! I'll make a cake and let Henri-sensei eat it!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.550
Wait, really?

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:27.940
Giving a cake you made to a super first-rate pâtissier?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.580
I'd be too scared to ever do that.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.490
Yeah.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.470
You got some guts, Ichigo-chan.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.560
Henri-sensei has never eaten a cake I made before.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.480
Okay! I'll make it tonight!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.430
Tonight?

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:43.310
Why not tomorrow?

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.820
I can't wait until tomorrow!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.880
So, well, go ahead and go to sleep first tonight, Rumi-san.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.490
You sure are happy, Ichigo-chan.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.920
Kashino...

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.410
What are you doing?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.000
Can't you tell by looking?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.810
He's practicing!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.040
<i>Someone</i> ditched last minute, so he's doing it by himself!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.550
O-Oh...

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:15.220
And what is the ditcher doing here?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:19.020
We came to make a cake and give it as a present to Henri-sensei!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:23.580
What? You broke your promise for something so selfish!?

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.730
You can use the cooking classroom for whatever you'd like!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.300
Ichigo, let's make it over there.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.780
R-Right...

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:40.240
Mari...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.660
So, Ichigo, what's Henri-sensei like?

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:51.310
Oh yeah. You've never met him, have you, Vanilla?

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:55.800
I met him by accident at the Sweets Festa in a department store.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:00.880
There were more sweets there than I could count, and I ate a ton.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.730
But there was one cake that had this nostalgic flavour...

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.740
It was Henri-sensei's cake.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.890
Oh?

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.440
What kind of cake was it?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.590
A milk mousse with strawberry gelée.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.450
I remember its taste like it was yesterday.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:28.050
A tingling sensation of strawberries overflowing from the soft, sweet milk mousse to melt on my tongue.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:35.470
Two flavours resounding with each other, leaving a bitter sweet sadness before vanishing...

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.230
It's just like...

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:40.160
Yes, just like first love...

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.040
I'll never forget it.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:49.810
After all, it's the taste that made me remember my dream of becoming a pâtissière.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:54.410
I'm making that cake from my memories.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.870
To me, it's a very special cake.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:00.490
No, it's a cake of fate!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:06.710
A fateful cake made in the image of one's first love?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.330
What's with the weird grin?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.220
Could it be, Ichigo?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.190
You fell in love with Henri-sensei?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.840
What are you yelling out? It's not like that!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.760
Ichigo, you're blushing!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.200
I just respect him as a teacher, and...

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.440
That scared me! What's the big deal?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.090
Aren't you being a bit too easy going?

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:39.440
It's almost time for the finals of the Cake Grand Prix...

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:42.550
We don't have time to be making some cake that's got nothing to do with it!

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.990
Well, maybe, but this is for Henri...

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:48.000
Henri this, Henri that... you're so noisy! Is that all you can say?

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.000
Why can't I call him Henri-sensei?

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.210
An idiot like you can only remember one thing at a time!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.750
If you've got enough time to get all excited, then practice tempering!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.360
I can do when, where and what I want, at my own discretion!

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.930
I don't want you ordering me around!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:16.660
I know I canceled special training all of a sudden, but he didn't have to be so mean!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.990
Kashino, that jerk!

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.240
Ichigo sure is difficult sometimes!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.900
She's way too immature and has trouble concentrating!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.060
Shut up!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:37.420
I'm sorry, Chocolat.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.440
Finished!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.950
You did it, Ichigo, wonderful!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:01.010
Magical macaron.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.690
Sweets Romance Card.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.920
Come out!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:09.660
All I need to do is wrap it up nice and pretty and they'll be finished.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.300
I hope Henri-sensei likes it.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:13.080
Yeah.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:20.300
The wrapping is cute, so give it your best shot, Ichigo!

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.090
I wonder what Henri-sensei will say?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.640
Fantastic!

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.620
How incredibly cute!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.150
You have amazing sense, Ichigo.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.570
Très bien!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:39.070
Ichigo, I'm impressed you've grown this much.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.820
My eyes were not wrong.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.320
Henri-sensei...

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.610
What's with your face?

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.790
You were imagining bad things like Ojou, weren't you?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:56.750
What are you saying, Vanilla? It's not like that...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.530
Oww...

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:01.250
Why did you do that, Ichigo?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.020
Oh, sorry...

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:05.530
You okay?

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.260
I hope Henri-sensei comes soon.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.770
I'll do anything, please forgive me!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.240
He's not coming, is he?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.800
Yeah...

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:29.980
Ichigo, class is going to start.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.030
Just a little longer...

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:35.680
It was Henri-sensei who got you into this academy, right?

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:38.290
I think he'll feel disappointed if you skip classes.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:43.000
And weren't you on ingredient duty today?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.300
Oh right, I was.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:47.300
I just had to be on duty today...

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.970
Ichigo-chan, that's the last batch.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.800
Right.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:57.810
Hey, Ichigo... Is the mousse going to be okay?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.460
Phew, that was close.

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.240
The mousse will collapse if it isn't properly refrigerated.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.390
Let's have it cool down for a bit.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:17.280
Henri-sensei seems like a hard person to run into.

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:19.080
This is nothing.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:22.210
In order to meet Henri-sensei I will brave hell and high water!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.060
That's my Ichigo!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:24.930
Oh, yeah!

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:28.380
How about I search for Henri-sensei during class?

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.560
Really, Vanilla?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:31.930
Thank you! I'm counting on you.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.760
I want to go home...

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.210
Yeah, it's getting boring.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.100
I don't really mind either way.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:47.240
Why are you three here?

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:55.160
Welcome to Salon de Marie.

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:58.350
Thanks for inviting me, Mari.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.170
I am glad that you came, Henri-sensei.

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:04.150
He really never stays in the same place for long.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.090
The second I find him, he's gone again.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:07.880
There he is!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:13.070
Sensei, would you try some of the latest cake I've created?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.760
Of course, I'd be glad to.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:22.490
Thank you for finding Henri-sensei, Vanilla!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.910
I see, he's in the Salon de Marie!

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.800
Yeah...

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:30.170
Ichigo, can it wait for another time?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:31.680
Huh, why?

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:34.030
Unless I hurry he's going to end up disappearing somewhere again!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.750
Henri-sensei!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.760
Thank you for the cake.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.320
How was it?

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:00.030
Your skills have improved, Mari.

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.820
It tasted incredible.

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:03.670
Thank you very much.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.940
During the high school class tomorrow, let's go with that cake.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:09.950
Mari, I'll need you to help me.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:11.220
Sure.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:14.610
Ichigo, Henri-sensei is leaving.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.110
Why don't you just say hi?

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.160
Come on, Ichigo...

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:23.090
Tennouji-san is Henri-sensei's favorite pupil.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:27.190
It's obvious that he'd come all the way from France to see her.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.160
I see.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:32.350
Ichigo-chan made a cake for Henri-sensei.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.680
She's been running around since this morning.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:38.350
Man, how dare she waste all this energy before the Grand Prix!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:43.350
If you keep being so angry, you'll get embittered and people will hate you.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.380
Hey, let's get started with special training, got it?

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.680
Oui!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.860
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.410
I'm totally in it today!

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.360
Time for special training, yeah!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:56.250
Amano-san...

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.250
Weren't you going to give that to Henri-sensei?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.620
Gotta preheat the oven...

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.790
You didn't see him?

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:08.990
Henri-sensei ate Tennouji-san's cake at the Salon de Marie.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.890
He looked really happy about it.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.690
I don't care anymore.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:15.380
Ichigo...

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:21.390
Maybe he forgot about me?

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.440
Ichigo!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:25.440
Amano-san!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:29.680
Caramel, why are <i>you</i> crying?

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.200
But, but...

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.080
I feel so bad for her!

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:35.000
You're ruining that lovely face of yours.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.450
Tears don't suit you, Ichigo-chan.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.350
You must be tired after running around like that.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:40.950
Take a seat.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.520
I was just getting hungry anyway.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.290
Let's all eat.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:57.460
I tried to recreate the cake that Henri-sensei made.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.840
But, it's nothing like it after all...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:03.670
You should just make cakes the way <i>you</i> want to.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.850
Don't try copying others.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.030
Kashino...

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.360
The mousse isn't very smooth.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.190
You tried to fix the decoration mistakes by covering it up with a strawberry.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:19.240
The strawberry gelée is stiff. You put in too much gelatin.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.700
You guys don't cut me any slack, do you?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.960
That's because we've got to help you grow a whole lot more.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.120
We tell you because we have high expectations.

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:32.590
Don't let President Tennouji get to you like that.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.580
We're up against her in the finals, remember?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:35.920
She's our rival!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.380
Exactly.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.780
President Tennouji!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.640
Bonjour, Ichigo.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.650
Henri-sensei!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.220
We finally see each other.

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:49.930
Henri-sensei...

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:51.500
Why are you here?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.110
I've been so busy I wasn't able to see you, Ichigo.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.010
So I got her to take me here.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:01.320
I showed him here only because he requested me to.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:09.040
Sensei... You remembered me?

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:12.580
Of course. How could I forget?

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:17.090
And we've been hearing of your achievements even in Paris, Ichigo.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:21.120
Sometimes I get reports from the Japan campus in Paris.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:26.100
So I knew that Team Ichigo had made it through to the Cake Grand Prix finals.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:30.950
And of course I read all the air mail you sent me, Ichigo.

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.690
I do apologise that I never replied.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.310
No, that's okay...

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:40.160
Just knowing that you read them is plenty!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.990
It's the same way...

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:49.370
Just like I always called him "sensei", even far away in Paris, he was still thinking of me!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:53.880
I wanted to eat a cake you made as soon as I could as well.

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:58.110
Oh, I made a cake for you, Henri-sensei!

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:02.870
It's gone!

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:06.140
I thought for sure there was one left!

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.760
Hey, Kashino!

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:11.580
You ate it! You pig!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.400
That's you, Cake Eating Contest Champion!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.310
Looks like you get along well.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:20.150
I apologise, Henri-sensei. I'll make a new one right away.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:22.740
There's no need for that.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:26.660
I'll be eating your cake at the Grand Prix, after all.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.510
Then...

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:29.490
...you're...

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.700
...a judge?

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:36.390
Yes. I will serve as a judge for the finals.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:41.420
I think it'll be difficult for you to win against Mari, the top in the entire academy, however...

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:43.630
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.930
I won't lose.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.440
No matter who I'm up against, I will not lose.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:52.100
I'm looking forward to it, Amano-san.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.800
I'll speak to the Queen for you.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:02.130
Thank you!

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:02.530
Later!

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.520
Thank you, Honey Pi-

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.500
I will not be called that again!

